BIOGRAPHY:
Dr. Fatima El-Zahraa is an active researcher and lecturer specializing in 
Computer Vision, Natural Language Processing (NLP), and AI-driven clinical informatics. 
As Associate Editor of the IST Online Journal, she leads the review workflow 
for AI, Machine Learning, and Big Data Analytics.

EDUCATION:
- Ph.D. in Computer Science (Specialization in Computer Vision)
  Sorbonne University, Paris, France (2010)
  Thesis: "Deep Feature Extractors for High-Resolution Satellite Imaging"
- M.Sc. in Computer Science
  University of Jordan, Amman (2005)
- B.Sc. in Computer Science (First Class Honors)
  Benghazi University, Libya (2001)

ACADEMIC APPOINTMENTS & ROLES:
- Associate Professor, Department of Computer Science
  Benghazi University, Libya (2018 - Present)
